    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d907">

                <pb facs="0954" n="942" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg942"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">311.6121 Gorin, M. N./45</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Attorney
                        General</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jackson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-03-20">March 20, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Attorney General</hi>: With reference to
                    our recent conversation regarding the case of Mikhail Gorin, a Soviet citizen
                    who has been sentenced to serve a term in prison by the United States District
                    Court for the Southern District of California, I feel that I should inform you
                    that in view of certain important considerations of an international nature, it
                    is the considered opinion of this Department that it would be to the public
                    interests of the United States for Mr. Gorin to be released on probation and on
                    condition that he leave the United States immediately and never return.</p>
                <p>If you should deem it appropriate so to do, I would have no objection to your
                    bringing the views of this Department to the attention of the Court.<anchor
                        n="34" xml:id="d907-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sumner Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d907-f1" n="34" xml:id="d907-f1-content">
                <p>The Judge did read this letter in court.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
